OL,3,GNEWSAWhat books had people turning
OL,4,Apages and turning up the volume this
OL,5,Ayear?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThrillers, self-help books and Harry
OL,8,FPotter were among the favourites for
OL,9,Freaders in Northern Ireland this year,
OL,10,Faccording to Libraries NI.
OL,12,FFor those who prefered to listen to
OL,13,Ftheir fiction, Freida McFadden had
OL,14,Feight of her titles featuring in the
OL,15,Ftop 10 adult fiction audiobooks
OL,16,Fborrowed.
OL,18,FJillian McFrederick from Libraries NI
OL,19,Fsaid books with "short chapters" and
OL,20,F"catchy, racy" themes seemed to be most
OL,21,Fpopular.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
